From: PW3 Android port
Subject: [PW3] perfprofd.rc: the path init starts is where the binary is

perfprofd's Android.bp builds a cc_binary, which installs to /system/bin, and
its init script starts /system/xbin/perfprofd. Nothing is at that path, so
init fails to start the service at every boot of a debug build and logs it.

The service is in debug builds only, so a release image never had the line;
a test image is where this project reads its logs, and a failure that is not
one costs the reader the same time either way.

--- a/perfprofd/perfprofd.rc
+++ b/perfprofd/perfprofd.rc
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
-service perfprofd /system/xbin/perfprofd
+service perfprofd /system/bin/perfprofd
     class late_start
     user root
     group root wakelock
     oneshot
     writepid /dev/cpuset/system-background/tasks
